+## Intent
+
+**Problem:** User ruling 2026-08-21 (~23:5xZ play session): director-spawned terminals still look randomly scattered — "not so great looking topology". The 5.12 soft bias (750‰ attach coin, cap 8) leaves too many strays and estates that read as noise; the user wants most nodes NEXT TO each other, like an estate, and after ~5 nodes a NEW area elsewhere, leaving routing room between sections.
+
+**Approach:** STRICT ESTATE (shape a from the briefing — the simpler one that satisfies both acceptance maps deterministically): every growth spawn is exactly one of two classes — ATTACH (an eligible cluster exists → candidate within adjacency radius of a member) or SEED (no eligible cluster → fresh area at ≥ new-area seed distance from every terminal, still in the outward-from-mesh annulus). Both classes keep the full E31 envelope. Existing 5.12 machinery (derived cluster view, attach draws, rejection sampling) is reused; the delta is the seed-distance predicate, the cap default 8→5, attach probability 750→1000, and the re-pinned tests + deliberate golden re-bless.
+
+## Boundaries & Constraints
+
+**Always:**
+- E31 spawn validity is the hard contract: bounds + min separation from every node/pipe + connectable-within-span; bounded rejection sampling from the same rng stream; deterministic, seed-derived, no serialization/LOG_VERSION change; growth spawns TERMINALS only, outward from the player-placed mesh, waits without a junction (story 5.1 / 3.5).
+- All tunables named in balance.json (ODN-5), loader fail-fast on missing/invalid keys; integer-only (ODN-10); no map iteration in core.
+- Cluster cap default 5 (`max_members`), new-area seed distance + adjacency radius (`radius_tiles`) as named knobs; a one-line balance.json change moves the cap.
+- Draw ORDER/counts per attempt unchanged where possible; the acceptance-pin tests update to the new policy (never deleted).
+
+**Ask First:**
+- None expected. If the strict contract cannot satisfy E31+connectability on the current map geometry, HALT rather than bending E31.
+
+**Never:**
+- No spawn-timing/cadence changes (`terminal_spawn_interval_ticks` stays 80), no node-type visual identity work (out of scope by the briefing), no routing semantics, no serialization/LOG_VERSION, no `terminal_min_sep_tiles` change (E31 packing floor).
+
+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| Fresh map, first spawn | No terminals yet | SEED: annulus draw, seed-distance filter vacuous, E31 | bounded rejection → skip window |
+| Eligible cluster exists | Any cluster size < cap | ATTACH: within radius of a member, E31 | rejected → re-draw (bounded) → skip window deterministically |
+| All clusters at cap | Every cluster ≥ cap | SEED: ≥ seed_dist from every live terminal, within span of a junction | rejected → re-draw (bounded) → skip window |
+| Dense map | Budget exhausted (8 attempts) | No spawn this window (deterministic, no stall) | N/A |
+| attach_prob < 1000 (user opt-in) | Coin misses | SEED family (the 08-17 minority-isolate mix, now seed-distance-respecting) | N/A |
+| No junction | Router not yet placed | Growth waits (unchanged) | N/A |
+| Malformed growth_groups block | Missing/invalid key in balance.json | Fail-fast load error naming the key | N/A |
